LucyTheAxe_Idle: {
	1: Гэй! Пасячы пару дрэў!
	2: Цудоўнае надвор'е для сячэння дрэваў.
	3: Ся-ся-сячы. Хех.
	4: Мы добрая дружына!
	5: Давай знойдзем невялічкі гай і проста раскрышым яго!
}
LucyTheAxe_Storage: {
	1: Гэта гамон.
	2: Тут цёмна!
	3: Дапамажыце! Выцягніце мяне адсюль!
	4: Тут няма што сячы!
	5: У мяне клаўстрафобія!
}
LucyTheAxe_ThrownAway: {
	1: Ты ж вернешся, так?
	2: Гэй! Я б ніколі цябе не кінула!
	3: Не забывайся пра мяне!
	4: Хіба мы не сябры?
	5: Ты ад мяне адмаўляешся?!
}
LucyTheAxe_PickedUp: {
	1: Oh, thank goodness!
	2: З гэтага часу мы будзем неразлучныя.
	3: Ahh, I'm back where I belong.
}
LucyTheAxe_ChoppedTree: {
	1: Яшчэ! Пасячом іншае!
	2: Гэта НЕЙМАВЕРНА!
	3: Здохні! Памры!
	4: Дзеля гэтага я жыву!
	5: Дурное дрэва!
	6: Я такая ЖВАВАЯ!
	7: У нас выйшла!
	8: ХА-ХА-ХА!
	9: Ву-у-у-у-у!
	10: ТА-А-А-К!
}
LucyTheAxe_GemTree.1: Так, каменныя дрэвы... Што з імі?
LucyTheAxe_ChoppedCactus.1: When you think about it, cacti are just prickly trees!
StardewTalk: {
	PlayerHasColaButIsNotHoldingIt: What's that you have... Joja Cola? Please hold it out, show me!
	PlayerHasColaAndIsHoldingIt: This unnatural beverage you hold has a connection to another world... I can try to purify it if you like.
	GiveColaButtonText: Purify
	PlayerGivesCola: I'm sensing a pure spirit through the connection, it wants to thank you for disposing of the Joja Cola!
}
Epitaph: {
	/* 1:
		'''
		Here lies Ted
		He bumped his head
		Now he's dead
		''' */
	/* 2:
		'''
		If you can read this
		You are standing on my chest
		''' */
	3: I told you I was sick!
	4: All dressed up and no place to go
	5: I will not be right back after this message
	6: It's dark down here
	7: Stay dead this time
	8: All shall join me one day
	9: Eul B. Next
	/* 10:
		'''
		Stole from the rich
		Gave to the needy
		Met his end when he got greedy
		''' */
	/* 11:
		'''
		The shell is here
		But the nut is gone
		''' */
	12: Sucks to be me
	/* 13:
		'''
		ONE WAY
		DO NOT ENTER
		''' */
	/* 14:
		'''
		Prepare yourself
		To follow me
		''' */
	/* 15:
		'''
		Go away
		I'm asleep
		''' */
	16: FOR RENT
	17: I knew this would happen
	18: I'd rather be reading this
	19: QUIET PLEASE
	20: Press F to pay respects
	/* 21:
		'''
		He made one little blunder
		Now he's six feet under
		''' */
	22: You should see the other guy
	/* 23:
		'''
		He caught a fishbone in his throat
		Which made him sing an angel's note
		''' */
	24: Here lies Ocram
	25: He's dead, Jim
	26: That's all folks
	/* 27:
		'''
		Tombstone?
		Over my dead body
		''' */
	28: Wish you were here
	29: See you soon
	30: Ran with scissors
	31: Didn't eat my vegetable
	32: He had the high ground
	33: Waiting to respawn
	/* 34:
		'''
		'Guide is kill'
		'No'
		''' */
	35: YOLO
	36: RIP in peace
	37: <-- I'm with stupid
	38: Hold my beer
	39: The final update
	40: Return to sender
	41: Let me out!
	42: Here lies Red's Tamagotchi
	43: I made an ash of myself
	44: Look out below!
	/* 45:
		'''
		He always lied while on the earth
		Now he's lying in it
		''' */
	/* 46:
		'''
		Soon ripe
		Soon rotten
		Soon gone
		But not forgotten
		''' */
	47: He didn't forward that email to ten people
}
