	LogicSensor_Above: Signals when the first player enters or the last player leaves the area above it
	LogicSensor_Honey: Signals when honey starts or stops touching it
	LogicSensor_Lava: Signals when lava starts or stops touching it
	LogicSensor_Liquid: Signals when any liquid starts or stops touching it
	LogicSensor_Moon: Signals at dusk
	LogicSensor_Sun: Signals at dawn
	LogicSensor_Water: Signals when water starts or stops touching it
