		{$CommonItemTooltip.GemEffectSapphire}
		{$CommonItemTooltip.GemStaff}
		''' */
	/* EmeraldStaff:
		'''
		{$CommonItemTooltip.GemEffectEmerald}
		{$CommonItemTooltip.GemStaff}
		''' */
	/* RubyStaff:
		'''
		{$CommonItemTooltip.GemEffectRuby}
		{$CommonItemTooltip.GemStaff}
		''' */
	/* DiamondStaff:
		'''
		{$CommonItemTooltip.GemEffectDiamond}
		{$CommonItemTooltip.GemStaff}
		''' */
	/* PalworldMinionTrustyCattiva:
		'''
		Summons Trusty Cattiva to fight for you
		A lovely pal that also helps your mining efforts
		{InputTrigger_InteractWithTile} to pet it!
		Its trust empowers it, and improved its 'Punch Flurry'!
		''' */
	/* PalworldMinionTrustyFoxsparks:
		'''
		Summons Trusty Foxparks to fight for you
		{InputTrigger_UseOrAttack} to use Foxparks' Huggy Fire skill, shooting flames!
		{InputTrigger_InteractWithTile} to pet it!
		Its trust empowers it, and it learned 'Spirit Fire'!
		''' */
	/* PalworldMountTrustyChillet:
		'''
		Summons Trusty Chillet for a ride!
		Empowers your attacks while mounted.
		Double tap a direction to use Rocket Slam!
		{InputTrigger_InteractWithTile} to pet it!
		Its trust empowers it, and increases its speed!
		''' */
	/* PalworldMountTrustyChilletIgnis:
		'''
		Summons Trusty Chillet Ignis for a ride!
		Empowers your attacks while mounted.
		Double tap a direction to use Rocket Slam!
		{InputTrigger_InteractWithTile} to pet it!
		Its trust empowers it, and increases its speed!
		''' */
	/* PalworldTrustyDigtoise:
		'''
		Summons Trusty Digtoise to help mining!
		{InputTrigger_UseOrAttack} to direct Digtoise
		{InputTrigger_InteractWithTile} away to recall Digtoise
		{InputTrigger_InteractWithTile} to pet it!
		Its trust empowers it, and it now matches your pickaxe power!
		''' */
	ClayPotMinion: Summons a clay bud to fight for you
	Marrow: Shoots fast bone arrows that shatter into shards
	/* ScoutSling:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.HeavySling}
		Enemies are less likely to target you
		5% increased damage
		''' */
	/* TemplarSling:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.HeavySling}
		10% increased sentry critical strike chance
		''' */
	/* RoyalGuardHarness:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.HeavySling}
		{$ItemTooltip.CobaltShield}
		''' */
	/* Pyroclast:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.MagmaStone}
		Periodically recharges with faint light
		Melee and ranged hits discharge an explosive slash
		''' */
	/* ArmletOfRuin:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.WickedArmlet}
		Periodically recharges with faint light
		Minion tag hits discharge ancient power
		''' */
	/* SeraphNecklace:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.HarpyCharm}
		{$ItemTooltip.CrossNecklace}
		''' */
	/* PhoenixQuiver:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.HarpyCharm}
		Increases arrow damage by 10% and greatly increases arrow speed
		20% chance not to consume arrows
		Lights wooden arrows ablaze
		'The flame of the phoenix'
		''' */
	/* WickedClaws:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.WickedArmlet}
		{$ItemTooltip.FeralClaws}
		''' */
	/* SilverShield:
		'''
		Grants immunity to knockback and fire blocks
		Increases your max number of summon tag effects by 1
		Significantly increases the duration of your summon tag effects
		''' */
	/* SweetBarb:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.HoneyComb}
		{$ItemTooltip.PoisonBarb}, and hits may release bees!
		''' */
	/* CatalystBand:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.PhilosophersStone}
		{$ItemTooltip.PoisonBarb}
		Increases damage of afflictions on enemies.
		''' */
	/* DruidicSerpentCloak:
		'''
		Every 3 swings, joins and attacks with your second whip
		{$ItemTooltip.StarCloak}
		''' */
	/* CrossedHeartNecklace:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.PanicNecklace}
		{$ItemTooltip.CrossNecklace}
		''' */
	/* RestorationShield:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.CobaltShield}
		{$ItemTooltip.ManaRegenerationBand}
		''' */
	/* MysticArtsSash:
		'''
		{$ItemTooltip.ManaRegenerationBand}
		{$ItemTooltip.BlackBelt}
		''' */
	/* OldStyleParkourBook:
		'''
		Allows moving in nostalgic ways.
		{InputTrigger_ToggleOrOpen} to deactivate effects
		'Because it's there!'
		''' */
	Petalstorm: Blooms mystic petals
	GlacierFang: Launches a charged icicle lance
	LightningStrike: Summons lightning strikes from the sky
	ForbiddenMinion: Summons forbidden ruins to fight for you
	/* ArcSurge:
		'''
		Unleashes powerful lightning to strike your foes
		'Unlimited POWER!'
		''' */
	/* PalworldLittleKinshipPeach:
		'''
		A small fruit filled with kindness
		It is said that a Pal who eats it will open its heart to humans
		Choose carefully which Pal you give it to
		''' */
	/* PalworldKinshipPeach:
		'''
		A rarely seen magical fruit
		It is said that a Pal who eats it will open its heart to humans
		Choose carefully which Pal you give it to
		''' */
	PiercingStarlight: Stabs with unmatched speed
	Chik: Hits charge a crystal explosion
	Cascade: Hits charge a fiery explosion
	TheEyeOfCthulhu: Hits with the power of the Eye of Cthulhu
	/* Kraken:
		'''
		Enchanted with sunken energy
		Hits charge a powerful wave
		''' */
	FormatC: Critical hits deal extra damage
	Yelets: Hits inflict Acid Venom
	/* OldStyleParkourBookInactive:
		'''
		Allows moving in nostalgic ways.
		Effects are currently inactive, {InputTrigger_ToggleOrOpen} to reactivate
		'Because it's there!'
		''' */
}
