	WorldDescriptionDefault_Title: Інфармацыя
	WorldDescriptionSecretSeeds_Title: Secret Seeds
	WorldCreationSeedMenuDescription: Customize your world's seed, or choose some game-changing ones!
	ResetDescription: Reset your world's type & seed.
	ResetDescription_Title: Скінуць
	WorldCreationRandomizeSeedDescription_Title: Выпадкова
	Seed_Everything: For the Worthy wasn’t enough? Featuring aspects of every other world seed combined with some brand new surprises, this world is here to break you. Get fixed, boi!
	Seed_Everything_Title: Zenith
	Seed_Remix: A land where up is down and down is up. Turn Terraria on its head in this inverted adventure. Will you be brave enough to explore The Up?
	Seed_Remix_Title: Remix
	Seed_NoTraps: Whoa, Traps. Ya hate ‘em, right? I hate them myself! This world has definitely been stripped of any and all traps... we think. Maybe.
	Seed_NoTraps_Title: No Traps
	Seed_ForTheWorthy: Are you Worthy? This is a world of no mercy. Forget what you know and sharpen your skills, lest you be weighed, measured, and found wanting...
	Seed_ForTheWorthy_Title: For the Worthy
	Seed_TheConstant: Bringing the Don’t Starve Together adventure into Terraria, can you survive persistent hunger as you seek to save Terraria? Oh, and don’t forget to stay in the light!
	Seed_TheConstant_Title: The Constant
	Seed_Celebration: 10 years of Terraria! Join the party in this colorful world of whimsy – who knows, maybe the team left some gifts behind for you to open.
	Seed_Celebration_Title: Celebration Mk 10
	Seed_Drunk: Crimson & Corruption? Together? Madness. This is the land of world generation gone wild, leading to a Terraria adventure like no other! Go home worldgen, you’re drunk!
	Seed_Drunk_Title: Drunk
	Seed_NotTheBees: Enter a land oozing with syrupy honey, where the buzzing of wings and the threat of venomous stingers awaits around every turn!  (Wicker helmet not included)
	Seed_NotTheBees_Title: Not the Bees
	Seed_Normal: Welcome to Terraria! Embark on your adventures with the original Terraria experience and gameplay.
	Seed_Normal_Title: Звычайна
	Seed_Skyblock: Enter a realm floating in the sky. With little to start with, you must build up your world from humble beginnings.
	Seed_Skyblock_Title: Skyblock
