}
WorkshopTags: {
	AdventureWorlds: Прыгода
	AdventureWorldsDescription: Hand-crafted Worlds where you go on an awesome adventure with defined rules!
	GolfWorlds: Golf
	GolfWorldsDescription: Handmade Terraria Golf Courses where you can tee off to set the course record.
	AllItemsWorlds: All Items
	AllItemsWorldsDescription: Worlds where you can find every item in chests.
	StarterWorlds: Starter
	StarterWorldsDescription: Worlds where you have a good head start.
	JourneyWorlds: Journey
	JourneyWorldsDescription: Worlds requiring Journey Mode characters – great power & great responsibility!
	ClassicWorlds: Класічная
	ClassicWorldsDescription: Worlds based in the standard Terraria experience setting.
	ExpertWorlds: Expert
	ExpertWorldsDescription: Worlds based on expert difficulty -  fortune and glory, kid!
	MasterWorlds: Майстар
	MasterWorldsDescription: Worlds based on Master difficulty, only for the foolhardy challenge-seeker!
	ChallengeWorlds: Кінуць выклік
	ChallengeWorldsDescription: Worlds that challenge your abilities! From Parkour to Puzzles and more!
	CorruptionWorlds: Corruption
	CorruptionWorldsDescription: Worlds infected by the evil Corruption.
	CrimsonWorlds: Crimson
	CrimsonWorldsDescription: Worlds afflicted by the all-devouring Crimson.
	SmallWorlds: Малая
	SmallWorldsDescription: Worlds that are small, compact, and comfortable!
	MediumWorlds: Сярэдняя
	MediumWorldsDescription: Worlds sized not too small or large, just right!
	LargeWorlds: Вялікі
	LargeWorldsDescription: Worlds large enough for a full party!
	OtherWorlds: Іншае
	OtherWorldsDescription: Worlds that serve another purpose, not to be confused with Otherworlds!
	FromTerrariaMods: From Mods
	FromTerrariaModsDescription: Resource packs with content based on mods.
	PopularCulture: Pop Culture
	PopularCultureDescription: Resource packs filled with popular culture.
	FunSilly: Fun/Silly
	FunSillyDescription: Resource packs of amusing, silly things. Your memes go here!
	Music: Музыка
	MusicDescription: Resource packs that alter Terraria's music, giving new vibes!
	LanguageTranslations: Translations
	LanguageTranslationsDescription: Resource packs that adjust translations, or add completely new ones!
	HighResolution: High-Res
	HighResolutionDescription: Resource packs which focus on high resolution content.
	Overhaul: Overhaul
	OverhaulDescription: Resource packs that completely overhaul a portion, or all of Terraria!
	Tweaks: Tweaks
	TweaksDescription: Resource packs that aim to only make minor changes to specific things.
	OtherResourcePacks: Іншае
	OtherResourcePacksDescription: Resource packs that serve another purpose, how otherworldly!
}
